@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@orderId = 72391
@orderNumber = P010773
@orderRevision = 0
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@sessionCookie = tuvansa_session=sesion-de-prueba

### Encuentra producto / Familias: cálculo ICOD='01201603' en el almacén 01
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/capture/products?warehouse=01&familyPattern=*************&exactCode=01201603
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Encuentra producto / Familias: prefijo de ICOD con proveedor VT en el almacén 01
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/capture/products?warehouse=01&familyPattern=VT***********&codePrefix=0120160
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Entrada inicial de la vista Pedidos (detalle directo, sin búsqueda ni COUNT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/by-number/{{orderNumber}}

### Buscar el pedido de captura
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?q=P010773&page=1&pageSize=25

### Buscador visual: todos los criterios son opcionales y combinables
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?orderNumber=P010773&customerOrderNumber=9063&customerCode=000033&orderedAt=2021-05-05&dueAt=2021-05-05&status=SURT&branch=0&warehouse=01&minimumFulfillmentPercentage=0&page=1&pageSize=100

### Botón Pedidos O.K.
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders?authorization=O.K.&page=1&pageSize=100

### Cargar pantalla Pedidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}

### Navegación inferior
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/previous

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/next

### Acciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/assign-all
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/authorize

### Autorizar. Copiar storage.revision de la ficha, o 0 para un pedido heredado sin revisión web.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/authorization
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"authorized":true,"revision":{{orderRevision}}}

### Desautorizar. Consultar la revisión vigente antes de enviar.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/authorization
Origin: {{origin}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"authorized":false,"revision":{{orderRevision}}}

### Auxiliar
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/auxiliar
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/boxes
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/classifications
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/comments
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/quote-conversion
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/duplicate
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/labels
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/print
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/monarch
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/pieces
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/transfer

### Acciones secundarias
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/assign-ct
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/consolidate
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/ct
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/split-ct
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/export
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/purchase-order
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/split
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/branch
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}/secondary-actions/wip

### Crear pedido desechable (cambie número, cliente y producto antes de ejecutar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "PAPI0001",
  "customerId": 15363,
  "customerOrderNumber": "PRUEBA API",
  "orderedAt": "2026-08-26",
  "from": "2026-08-26",
  "dueAt": "2026-08-26",
  "warehouse": "01",
  "currencyId": 1,
  "lines": [{ "productId": 10590, "quantity": 1, "price": 1, "discount": 0 }]
}

### Editar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "observations": "PRUEBA CONTROLADA" }

### Eliminar (solo pedido desechable no surtido y sin factura)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sales/orders/{{orderId}}
